#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:288
msgid "Default argument values are not permitted."
msgstr "Zadane vrijednosti argumenata nisu dopuštene."

#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:289
msgid "Floating point may be used but is not optimised."
msgstr "Pomični zarez se može koristiti, ali nije optimiziran."

#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:291
msgid "Viper provides pointer types to assist the optimiser. These comprise"
msgstr "Viper pruža tipove pokazivača za pomoć optimizatoru. Oni obuhvaćaju"

#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:293
msgid "``ptr`` Pointer to an object."
msgstr "``ptr`` Pokazivač na objekt."

#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:294
msgid "``ptr8`` Points to a byte."
msgstr "``ptr8`` Pokazuje na bajt."

#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:295
msgid "``ptr16`` Points to a 16 bit half-word."
msgstr "``ptr16`` Pokazuje na 16-bitnu polu-riječ."

#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:296
msgid "``ptr32`` Points to a 32 bit machine word."
msgstr "``ptr32`` Pokazuje na 32-bitnu strojnu riječ."

#: ../../reference/speed_python.rst:298
msgid ""
"The concept of a pointer may be unfamiliar to Python programmers. It has "
"similarities to a Python `memoryview` object in that it provides direct "
"access to data stored in memory. Items are accessed using subscript "
"notation, but slices are not supported: a pointer can return a single item "
"only. Its purpose is to provide fast random access to data stored in "
"contiguous memory locations - such as data stored in objects which support "
"the buffer protocol, and memory-mapped peripheral registers in a "
"microcontroller. It should be noted that programming using pointers is "
"hazardous: bounds checking is not performed and the compiler does nothing to"
" prevent buffer overrun errors."
msgstr ""
"Koncept pokazivača može biti nepoznat Python programerima. Ima sličnosti s "
"Pythonovim objektom `memoryview` u tome što pruža izravan pristup podacima "
"pohranjenima u memoriji. Stavkama se pristupa pomoću notacije indeksa, ali "
"isječci nisu podržani: pokazivač može vratiti samo jednu stavku. Njegova je "
"svrha pružiti brzi nasumični pristup podacima pohranjenima na susjednim "
"memorijskim lokacijama - poput podataka pohranjenih u objektima koji "
"podržavaju protokol međuspremnika, te memorijski mapiranih registara "
"periferije u mikrokontroleru. Treba napomenuti da je programiranje pomoću "
"pokazivača opasno: ne provodi se provjera granica i kompilator ne čini ništa"
" kako bi spriječio pogreške prekoračenja međuspremnika."

